From ballombe at debian.org  Fri Jun 15 20:20:34 2018
From: ballombe at debian.org (Bill Allombert)
Date: Fri, 15 Jun 2018 21:20:34 +0200
Subject: [R-pkg-team] Bug#901625: dh-r has circular Depends on r-base-dev
Message-ID: <20180615192034.GA7829@yellowpig>

Package: dh-r
Version: 20180613
Severity: important

Hello Debian R Packages Maintainers,

There is a circular dependency between dh-r and r-base-dev:

dh-r:       Depends: r-base-dev
r-base-dev: Depends: dh-r

Circular dependencies are known to cause problems
during upgrade between stable releases, so we should try to avoid them.

Cheers,
-- 
Bill. <ballombe at debian.org>

Imagine a large red swirl here. 


